{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The evaluation phase of the current render pass."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SQ","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SH","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/s8SendableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single frame may traverse the view tree several times before anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches the terminal:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Layout measurement","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — containers call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sizeThatFits"},{"type":"text","text":" (or render to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"measure) arbitrarily often to negotiate sizes, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"performs a full sizing pass on the first frame to discover the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"header height. None of these traversals produce the frame’s output."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Candidate-tree evaluation","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the pass whose buffer becomes (or may","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"become) the frame’s terminal output. A frame can evaluate more than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one candidate: when the header height turns out different from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"estimate, a correction pass re-evaluates the tree and the earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"candidate is discarded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderPhase"},{"type":"text","text":" makes this distinction explicit on "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that effect sites can tell sizing work apart from output work."}]},{"text":"Invariants","anchor":"Invariants","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"no effect may reach live runtime state","type":"text"}]},{"text":": no lifecycle","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or task mounting, no focus or handler registration, no state, cache,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"preference, header, status-bar, or terminal mutation. Bodies must be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evaluable arbitrarily often without observable consequences.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render"},{"type":"text","text":", effects belong to a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"candidate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" tree. They must not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applied to live runtime state during traversal either, because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidate may still be discarded by a correction pass. Instead they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded and applied exactly once when the frame commits (see the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"classification rule below)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Committing is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a phase of this enum: no view body is ever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evaluated while the frame commits. The commit is an explicit step in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop.render()"},{"type":"text","text":" after the final candidate is known."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Classifying an effect","anchor":"Classifying-an-effect","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When writing or reviewing an effect site, ask one question:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Does the effect outlive the frame?”"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (key handlers, preference values, status-bar items, header"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer, focus registrations): write it into the current pass’s scratch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collector. The final pass’s collector replaces the live state wholesale;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discarded passes are simply dropped."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDisappear"},{"type":"text","text":" actions, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".task"},{"type":"text","text":" mounts, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPreferenceChange"},{"type":"text","text":" actions, GC liveness): record it. The frame"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commit diffs the final records against persistent runtime state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applies the difference exactly once."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This mirrors SwiftUI’s model, where per-update values are recomputed and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replaced with each committed tree, while lifetime effects derive from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identity diff between committed trees."}]},{"name":"See Also","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and the frame choreography comment on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" for where each phase begins and ends."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10TUIkitView11RenderPhaseO","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RenderPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"RenderPhase","symbolKind":"enum"},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/Equatable-Implementations":{"title":"Equatable Implementations","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/equatable-implementations","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/Equatable-Implementations","role":"collectionGroup","abstract":[]},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/render":{"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/render","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Candidate-tree evaluation for the frame’s output. Effects are"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recorded for the frame commit, never applied directly.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"RenderPhase.render","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"render"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase/measure":{"title":"RenderPhase.measure","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase\/measure","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"measure"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Layout sizing. Bodies may be evaluated arbitrarily often; no effect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"may reach live runtime state.","type":"text"}]},"doc://TUIkit/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Hashable","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SH"},"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/RenderPhase":{"title":"RenderPhase","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUI